When the user asks for a risk review, a security review, or whether the app
is ready for real users or payments:

1. Read `.open-risk-review/SKILL.md` and follow it step by step.
2. Use `.open-risk-review/CHECKLIST.md` for the controls and
   `.open-risk-review/TEMPLATE.md` for the report.
3. Stay read-only until the report is written and the user asks for fixes.
